Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chip_Biffington.\" title=\"Chip Biffington.\">Chip Biffington.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_system_of_endless_plates.\" title=\"The system of endless plates.\">The system of endless plates.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Long-legged lobster.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">Series 14</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 3 November 2022. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\">Sarah Millican</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Long-legged_lobster.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A \"long-legged lobster', is what <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> likens <a href=\"/wiki/Munya_Chawawa\" title=\"Munya Chawawa\">Munya Chawawa</a>'s painted unicorn to, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Paint_a_picture_of_a_unicorn_using_your_head_brush\" title=\"Paint a picture of a unicorn using your head brush\">Paint a picture of a unicorn using your head brush</a> task. The title card is of milk in a bottle, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Pick_up_both_milk_bottles_and_hold_them_directly_above_the_microwaves\" title=\"Pick up both milk bottles and hold them directly above the microwaves\">Pick up both milk bottles and hold them directly above the microwaves</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Long-legged_lobster.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Langbenet hummer', which translates as 'Long-legged lobster'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pitkäjalkainen hummeri', which translates as 'Long-legged lobster'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Långbent hummer', which translates as 'Long-legged lobster'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Long-legged_lobster.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Dara Ó Briain</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fern Brady</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Kearns</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Munya_Chawawa\" title=\"Munya Chawawa\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Munya Chawawa</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Millican</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_you%27ve_ever_received_in_the_post\" title=\"Best thing you&#39;ve ever received in the post\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing you've ever received in the post.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pick_up_both_milk_bottles_and_hold_them_directly_above_the_microwaves\" title=\"Pick up both milk bottles and hold them directly above the microwaves\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Within 30 seconds of opening this task, you must pick up both milk bottles and hold them directly above the microwaves. The clock stops when a milk bottle, hand or arm touches a microwave or is no longer directly above a microwave. Lowest number on the clock wins, but if the clock reaches zero, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_to_the_end_of_the_lanes_in_exactly_the_same_amount_of_time\" title=\"Get to the end of the lanes in exactly the same amount of time\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get to the end of the lanes in exactly the same amount of time. That time must be under one minute. Also, you must mirror yourself during your attempts.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><b>Bonus:</b> Most stylish mirroring.</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_the_bullseye_with_your_paint\" title=\"Strike the bullseye with your paint\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Strike the bullseye with your paint. You must only step on the stepping stones and you must step on all the stepping stones. Also, your hands must be below your waist at all times.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Paint_a_picture_of_a_unicorn_using_your_head_brush\" title=\"Paint a picture of a unicorn using your head brush\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Paint a picture of a unicorn using your head brush. You may not handle your head brush at any point.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Long-legged_lobster.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span cl